INSTALLATION & USAGE:
================================================================================

1. Extract mindwash-ai-source.zip
2. npm install
3. npm run dev (development)
4. npm run build (production)

Live Demo:
  - The artifact "MindWash AI - AI Tools Discovery Platform" is fully functional
  - All features work in the browser
  - Try searching, filtering, comparing tools

LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
  - Open http://localhost:5173 after npm run dev
  - Changes auto-reload
  - Full hot module replacement (HMR)

PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT:
  - Use mindwash-ai.html directly
  - Or deploy dist/ folder to:
    * Vercel (npm: vercel)
    * Netlify (drag & drop dist/)
    * GitHub Pages
    * Any static hosting

